<title>CHINA: China to build 3.067 bln yuan power plant.</title>
<headline>China to build 3.067 bln yuan power plant.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's State Planning Commission said on Friday it has approved construction of the 3.067 billion yuan ($369.5 million) Gaobazhou hydroelectric power plant in central Hubei province.</p>
<p>The plant would be built on the Qingjiang River, one of the tributaries of the Yangtze, an official said without giving further details.</p>
<p>($1= 8.3 yuan)</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
